# Multitasking P-d (task 015-pd): the home grid with the apps left open marked (a green dot with a ring of the tile's
# colour at the tile's top right, mockup) and the one-time hint on the toast (D15; "Alt+Tab switches apps" without a
# three-finger touch screen). The dots are hidden again when the apps close: the grid is then pixel-identical to the
# grid before (no trace). The reference is taken after a selection round trip (the first frames of the grid and the
# ones after a key differ in a few anti-aliased edge pixels, with or without dots).
title multitask home dots
sizes 640x480 800x480 720x720 1280x720 1024x600
@1024x600 ppmm 660
apps "Mesh Hop=ip_panel_100.png" "Serial Console=cli_100.png" "System Monitor=game_100.png" "RSS Reader=fixture:store_100.png" Settings CLI
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
key RIGHT
key LEFT
shot home_plain
dots "Mesh Hop" "Serial Console"
toast Hold three fingers to switch apps
shot home_dots_hint
toast off
key RIGHT
shot home_dots_selected
key LEFT
dots
expect_same home_plain
toast Alt+Tab switches apps
shot home_hint_keyboard
toast off
